# AI Document Analyzer - API Tests

### Upload a document
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-document.pdf
--boundary--

### Get all documents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents

### Get document by ID (replace with actual ID from upload response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/your-document-id-here

### Python AI health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
